    "body": "\"scan response\" in this context means an advertisement data packet with a PDU Type of `SCN_RSP`.  What types of advertisement data it contains depends entirely on the peripheral device. \r\n\r\nI would expect `watchAdvertisements` and `requestLEScan` to return the same info for the same device, so if it isn't, that sounds like a potential implementation bug to me.",
